WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.156 --> 00:00:01.989
- We need to break up.

00:00:01.989 --> 00:00:03.010
- You said you wouldn't judge me!

00:00:03.010 --> 00:00:04.240
- Not really break up.

00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:05.460
We need to pretend to break up

00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:07.020
in order for you to win the election.

00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:09.670
Right now you and Astrid are
splitting the sympathy vote.

00:00:09.670 --> 00:00:12.163
I am going to confess
that I cheated on you.

00:00:13.620 --> 00:00:14.900
It'll be a scandal.

00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:17.580
You will dump me and everyone
will feel sorry for you.

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:19.100
I've cleared it with McAfee and James,

00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:20.780
they think it could gain
you six to nine points

00:00:20.780 --> 00:00:23.480
depending on how magnanimous
you are about the whole thing.

00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:25.180
- But everyone will hate you.

00:00:25.180 --> 00:00:26.133
- I love you.

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:32.220
This is what love looks like, Payton.

00:00:32.220 --> 00:00:34.170
This is what sacrifice looks like.

00:00:34.170 --> 00:00:38.270
This is what it takes to change the world.

00:00:38.270 --> 00:00:39.650
I am your first lady,

00:00:39.650 --> 00:00:43.023
today and always.

00:00:44.490 --> 00:00:46.190
But there are rules.

00:00:46.190 --> 00:00:47.023
- Rules?

00:00:47.023 --> 00:00:48.600
- We will break up

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:49.770
long enough for you to win

00:00:49.770 --> 00:00:52.370
and for no one to suspect
duplicity on our parts,

00:00:52.370 --> 00:00:54.970
you will post photos of Big Sur,

00:00:54.970 --> 00:00:58.210
the truffle french fries at
Hoagies Diner on route 14,

00:00:58.210 --> 00:01:00.730
and cute dogs on your Instagram

00:01:00.730 --> 00:01:01.730
at least once a day

00:01:01.730 --> 00:01:03.663
with captions like,

00:01:04.527 --> 00:01:05.540
"Wish I was here,"

00:01:05.540 --> 00:01:07.730
and "Yummy,"

00:01:07.730 --> 00:01:09.083
and heart emoji.

00:01:10.070 --> 00:01:11.490
When you do so,

00:01:11.490 --> 00:01:13.630
I will know you are thinking of me.

00:01:13.630 --> 00:01:15.420
- A secret code, I love it.

00:01:15.420 --> 00:01:19.033
- And most importantly,

00:01:20.800 --> 00:01:21.870
when you pass me in the hall,

00:01:21.870 --> 00:01:24.670
you will not pay me any mind

00:01:24.670 --> 00:01:26.500
but as soon as we're past each other,

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:28.120
you will turn

00:01:28.120 --> 00:01:29.610
and look back.

00:01:29.610 --> 00:01:30.960
I need you to do this for me

00:01:30.960 --> 00:01:33.150
or I won't be able to survive.

00:01:33.150 --> 00:01:35.160
Do you agree to these terms?

00:01:35.160 --> 00:01:37.583
- You are the best thing
that will ever happen to me.

00:01:38.670 --> 00:01:39.503
Yes.

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:41.533
I agree.

00:01:43.100 --> 00:01:44.941
- Let's move on to fish course.

00:01:44.941 --> 00:01:46.120
(gong chimes)

00:01:46.120 --> 00:01:48.550
I don't wanna say I'm
overwhelmed with shame,

00:01:48.550 --> 00:01:49.383
that's too calculating.

00:01:49.383 --> 00:01:50.216
It sounds fake.

00:01:50.216 --> 00:01:51.173
- It is fake.
- No.

00:01:52.876 --> 00:01:54.907
(key clicks)

00:01:54.907 --> 00:01:56.767
"I broke up with Payton tonight.

00:01:56.767 --> 00:01:58.477
"I guess you could say I cheated on him,

00:01:58.477 --> 00:02:00.657
"though it's more complicated than that.

00:02:00.657 --> 00:02:02.677
"I will not name the other
party involved at this time

00:02:02.677 --> 00:02:04.890
"out of respect to their family," period.

00:02:04.890 --> 00:02:05.723
- That's good.

00:02:05.723 --> 00:02:07.940
Mysterious, really makes you lean in.

00:02:07.940 --> 00:02:09.136
- Post it.

00:02:09.136 --> 00:02:12.777
(suspenseful music)

00:02:12.777 --> 00:02:15.194
(key clicks)

00:02:16.932 --> 00:02:19.400
(computer chimes)

00:02:19.400 --> 00:02:20.440
- This is good.

00:02:20.440 --> 00:02:21.910
- Jesus, people are freaking animals.

00:02:21.910 --> 00:02:22.850
These comments are brutal.

00:02:22.850 --> 00:02:24.250
- [James] This is really good.

00:02:24.250 --> 00:02:26.892
(computer chimes)

00:02:26.892 --> 00:02:30.406
(suspenseful music)

00:02:30.406 --> 00:02:33.156
(phone vibrates)

00:02:34.757 --> 00:02:35.886
- Hi.

00:02:35.886 --> 00:02:36.719
- Hi.

00:02:38.130 --> 00:02:39.915
I didn't like doing that.

00:02:39.915 --> 00:02:42.690
- I know, it's the right thing to do.

00:02:42.690 --> 00:02:45.690
(suspenseful music)

00:02:47.937 --> 00:02:49.634
- Hey, Payton.

00:02:49.634 --> 00:02:50.938
We're ready when you are buddy.

00:02:50.938 --> 00:02:51.771
- Okay.

00:02:55.946 --> 00:02:57.253
(key clicks)

00:02:57.253 --> 00:03:00.045
(computer chimes)

00:03:00.045 --> 00:03:02.962
(melancholy music)

00:03:12.884 --> 00:03:15.467
♪ I was raging ♪

00:03:15.467 --> 00:03:18.093
♪ It was late ♪

00:03:18.093 --> 00:03:21.792
♪ In the world my demons cultivate ♪

00:03:21.792 --> 00:03:24.806
♪ I felt the strangest emotion ♪

00:03:24.806 --> 00:03:29.806
♪ But it wasn't hate, for once ♪

00:03:34.139 --> 00:03:36.711
♪ Yes I'm changing ♪

00:03:36.711 --> 00:03:39.274
♪ Yes I'm gone ♪

00:03:39.274 --> 00:03:40.107
- Payton.

00:03:40.981 --> 00:03:41.814
Hey kiddo.

00:03:43.300 --> 00:03:45.020
Look I know you've been
struggling with Mandarin

00:03:45.020 --> 00:03:47.047
and River was tutoring you.

00:03:48.370 --> 00:03:50.660
You must be going through a lot right now.

00:03:50.660 --> 00:03:51.493
- Yeah, I am.

00:03:52.350 --> 00:03:53.850
- Just show up for the exams

00:03:53.850 --> 00:03:55.370
and I'll give you an A, okay?

00:03:57.124 --> 00:03:57.957
- Thank you.
- Okay.

00:03:57.957 --> 00:04:01.160
♪ Can't you see ♪

00:04:01.160 --> 00:04:02.690
- Hey man, I'm really sorry.

00:04:02.690 --> 00:04:03.870
Numbers look great, this was genius.

00:04:03.870 --> 00:04:04.870
I wish I thought of it.

00:04:04.870 --> 00:04:07.183
Go to the cafeteria and press the flesh.

00:04:07.183 --> 00:04:10.361
♪ And I was searching endlessly ♪

00:04:10.361 --> 00:04:14.499
♪ But baby now there's nothing left ♪

00:04:14.499 --> 00:04:19.499
♪ That I can do ♪

00:04:19.844 --> 00:04:24.844
♪ So don't be blue ♪

00:04:25.513 --> 00:04:29.173
♪ There is another future ♪

00:04:29.173 --> 00:04:34.173
♪ Waiting there for you ♪

00:04:37.003 --> 00:04:42.003
♪ It's calling out for you ♪

00:04:42.419 --> 00:04:47.419
♪ Arise and walk, come through ♪

00:04:47.605 --> 00:04:52.605
♪ Someone beyond that door ♪

00:04:53.074 --> 00:04:56.491
♪ Is calling out for you ♪

